{'symbol': 'STT', 'date': '2019-10-17 22:30:00', 'title': 'STATE STREET CORPORATION ANNOUNCES EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019', 'text': 'STATE STREET CORPORATION ANNOUNCED EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019. FOR THE QUARTER, THE COMPANY REPORTED TOTAL REVENUE OF $2,903 MILLION AGAINST $2,989 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET INCOME WAS $583 MILLION AGAINST $764 MILLION A YEAR AGO. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS $1.42 AGAINST $1.87 A YEAR AGO.'}